# Firebase Configuration
# Bu degerleri Firebase Console'dan alin: https://console.firebase.google.com
# Project Settings > General > Your apps > Firebase SDK snippet
#
# GUVENLIK NOTU: Bu degerler client-side'da gorunur olacaktir.
# Bu tasarim geregi boyledir. Guvenlik su mekanizmalarla saglanir:
# 1. Firestore Security Rules (authentication zorunlu)
# 2. Firebase App Check (attestation)
# 3. API key restrictions (Firebase Console'da)

FIREBASE_API_KEY=your_api_key_here
FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN=your_project.firebaseapp.com
FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=your_project_id
FIREBASE_STORAGE_BUCKET=your_project.appspot.com
FIREBASE_MESSAGING_SENDER_ID=your_sender_id
FIREBASE_APP_ID=your_app_id

# Google OAuth Client IDs
# Bu degerleri Google Cloud Console'dan alin: https://console.cloud.google.com
# APIs & Services > Credentials > OAuth 2.0 Client IDs
GOOGLE_ANDROID_CLIENT_ID=your_android_client_id.apps.googleusercontent.com
GOOGLE_WEB_CLIENT_ID=your_web_client_id.apps.googleusercontent.com

# ============================================
# FIREBASE APP CHECK (Opsiyonel ama Onerilen)
# ============================================

# ReCAPTCHA Enterprise Site Key (Web builds icin)
# Google Cloud Console > reCAPTCHA Enterprise > Create Key
# Key type: "Website" secin ve domain'inizi ekleyin
RECAPTCHA_SITE_KEY=your_recaptcha_site_key_here

# App Check Debug Token (Sadece development icin)
# Firebase Console > Project Settings > App Check > Apps > Manage debug tokens
# Yeni bir debug token olusturun ve buraya yapistin
# UYARI: Bu token'i production build'lerde KULLANMAYIN!
APPCHECK_DEBUG_TOKEN=your_debug_token_here

# ============================================
# AI SERVICE API KEYS — KALDIRILDI
# ============================================
#
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY ve GEMINI_API_KEY buradan cikarildi.
#
# ONEMLI: react-native-config .env'deki TUM degerleri BuildConfig'e gomer,
# yani JS tarafi okumasa bile APK'dan cikarilabilirler. AI ozelligi
# kaldirildigi icin bu anahtarlarin .env'de bulunmasi sadece risk.
#
# Kendi yerel .env dosyanizda hala duruyorlarsa SILIN.

# ============================================
# API KEY ROTATION RUNBOOK (Sprint 52)
# ============================================
# Bu dosyadaki her API key icin production oncesi rotation proseduru:
#
# 1. FIREBASE_API_KEY (90 gunde bir)
#    - Firebase Console > Project Settings > General
#    - "Web API Key" kopyala
#    - Eski key'i Firebase Console'da "Restrict Key" ile kisitla
#    - Yeni key olustur, eskiyi 24 saat sonra sil
#    - Android: google-services.json otomatik gunceller
#    - iOS: GoogleService-Info.plist manuel guncelleme
#
# 2. GOOGLE_ANDROID_CLIENT_ID (6 ayda bir)
#    - Google Cloud Console > APIs & Services > Credentials
#    - OAuth 2.0 Client ID > Android client sec
#    - "Reset Secret" ile yeni secret olustur
#    - SHA-1 fingerprint degerleri eski ile ayni olmali
#    - Yeni secret'i .env'e yaz
#
# 3. GOOGLE_WEB_CLIENT_ID (6 ayda bir)
#    - Google Cloud Console > APIs & Services > Credentials
#    - OAuth 2.0 Client ID > Web client sec
#    - Authorized JavaScript origins kontrol et
#    - Yeni secret olustur
#
# 4. ANTHROPIC_API_KEY / GEMINI_API_KEY — ARTIK YOK
#    AI ozelligi kaldirildi; rotasyon gerekmiyor.
#
# 5. RECAPTCHA_SITE_KEY (yilda bir)
#    - Google Cloud Console > reCAPTCHA Enterprise
#    - Domain listesini kontrol et
#    - Yeni key olusturmak gerekirse eski 24 saat onceden degistir
#
# 7. APPCHECK_DEBUG_TOKEN (gelistirici basina)
#    - Firebase Console > App Check > Manage debug tokens
#    - Yeni gelistirici icin yeni token
#    - Production build'lerde KULLANILMAZ
#
# OTOMATIK ROTATION ICIN ONERILER:
# - GitHub Actions + Secret Manager (production CI/CD)
# - AWS Secrets Manager rotation lambdas
# - GCP Secret Manager + Cloud Scheduler
# - Bitwarden/1Password CLI ile guvenli secret store
#
# ACIL DURUMDA KEY COMPROMISE:
# 1. Tum key'leri HEMEN revoke edin
# 2. Firebase Security Rules'u kontrol edin (yetkisiz erisim)
# 3. Firestore audit log'larini inceleyin
# 4. Yeni key'ler olusturun, .env'i guncelleyin
# 5. CI/CD'yi yeni key ile re-deploy edin
# 6. Post-mortem yazin, process iyilestirin

